      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشَارَجَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>being like, one to another.</i> (O,
K.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شارجهُ</span> <i>He was like to him;</i> or <i>it,
to it:</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَارَجَا</span> <i>They two were like, each to the
other.</i> (TK.)

